run-fna.content:
Run the FNA automation. Trigger: user drops an FNA collection sheet PDF and says "run fna."

This skill is self-contained. No external files required. Works on Mac and Windows.

---

## STEP 1 — PARSE THE PDF

Extract all client data from the dropped PDF:
- Client: first name, last name, DOB, phone
- Marital status. If married: spouse first name, last name, DOB
- Income: gross amount, frequency, owner (Client or Spouse) — repeat for each source
- Tax rate
- Expenses: mortgage/rent, utilities, auto, food, household, health, other debt service, other monthly
- Debts: type, description, term (years), balance, interest rate, monthly payment — repeat for each
- Assets: name, type, owner, current value, monthly additions, use for retirement? — repeat for each
- Existing policies: insured, owner, type, provider, term, face amount, cash value, premium, mode — repeat for each
- Retirement goals: retirement age (client + spouse), life expectancy, desired monthly income, include Social Security?
- DIME: monthly income to replace, education cost

Flag any missing required fields before proceeding.

---

## STEP 2 — CONFIRM BROWSER IS AUTHENTICATED

Take a screenshot of the current browser state. If mywfg.com is not logged in, stop and tell the user to log in manually (IBM ISAM MFA — cannot automate). Resume when confirmed.

---

## STEP 3 — CREATE A NEW FNA

Navigate to `https://www.mywfg.com/createfna/0`.
Wait for redirect. Extract the FNA ID from the URL (`/FnaEdit/{ID}`).

---

## STEP 4 — FILL ALL SECTIONS

Use `browser_evaluate` for all field fills. Each `showAdd*()` call must be in a separate evaluate from the field fills that follow it.

### Household Info — nav: `hypHousehold`

```javascript
document.getElementById('ContactFirstName').value = '...';
document.getElementById('ContactLastName').value = '...';
document.getElementById('ContactDOB').value = 'M/D/YYYY';
document.getElementById('ContactStatus').checked = true; // married
document.getElementById('ContactPhone').value = '...';
document.getElementById('SpouseFirstName').value = '...';  // only if married
document.getElementById('SpouseLastName').value = '...';
document.getElementById('SpouseDOB').value = 'M/D/YYYY';
document.getElementById('FnaDescription').value = 'LastName - Date';
saveHouseholdEntry(false);
// Dismiss "new contact created" dialog by clicking Continue
```

### Cash Flow — Income — nav: `hypCashflow` then `preshowIncome()`

```javascript
// Call showAddIncome() in a separate evaluate first, then fill:
document.getElementById('Owner').value = 'Client'; // or 'Spouse'
document.getElementById('Source').value = 'Employment';
document.getElementById('GrossAmount').value = '3142';
document.getElementById('Frequency').value = 'Monthly x12'; // Annual x1 | Monthly x12 | Semi-Monthly x24 | Bi-Weekly x26 | Weekly x52
